{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"轻松退去后，他还记得那一步确实让自己重新动起来，所以仍愿意坚持。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新动起来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他确实因熟悉的亲近快乐过，当时看似坚定也在努力撑住自己，如今的不安没让他认定先前那一步走错了。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐过\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他反复追问过去还能怎样，问不出答案又拿自己定下的事逼自己往前，一停下来就得面对那份亲近回不到从前。\",\n      \"key\": \"回不到从前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"那一步确实有用，能让他继续往前，却带不回熟悉的亲近，他还不知道怎么面对这份不舍。\",\n      \"key\": \"带不回熟悉的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R14\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留决定重新浮现后的坚持，并接回此前不再等到彻底想清才行动、实际重新获得行动力量的经历，说明他为何仍不肯放弃。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补回\",\n      \"why\": \"找回先前的亲近和快乐确实发生过、当时的坚定也包含努力撑住自己的成分，以及眼下的不安并不能证明先前走错了这三个相连的心理事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的另一个要求写成对过去反复追问、靠自己定下的事逼自己向前，以及亲近无法照旧回来的现实，解释思绪停不下来、行动也无法让他安心的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动确实有用却仍然不够的判断，明确它能让他继续向前，却带不回熟悉的亲近，也无法替他解决如何面对不舍的问题，为后面不愿放手的冲突留下具体前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "56235bf5-c243-42c8-ab52-d70132b8db8f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T115100023574Z", "elapsed_seconds": 757.797, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T12:03:37.830784+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18eed394b5307d6e5bd3815311975e1393c9af6a07f63253e5c95fd43ab9d12a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1